                                                "sense_id": "3f2f4909-0575-3212-a1a5-8745184290f9",
                                                "text": "Curiously, female sweat bees, as are most others bees, wasps, and ants in the order Hymenoptera, are haplodiploid organisms, in which fertilized eggs become female young and unfertilized eggs become males."
                                            }
